; Moves one variable: a write after the scene has drawn. The golden's host calls change each input
; the 2D light pass reads, after the first frames have filled its buffers: a point light's energy,
; colour, position and blend mode, an occluder's position, a directional light's energy, the canvas
; modulate and a lit item's position. The capture must show the written values, not the authored ones.
; Every other light golden captures its authored values only, so a pass that keeps stale buffers
; after a write passes them all.

